        "intent_summary": "Move device initialization and release assignment before private info allocation to ensure proper device cleanup on allocation failure.",
        "what": "Moved the assignment of mci->dev.release and the call to device_initialize(&mci->dev) from after the kzalloc of pvt_info to before it.",
